{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:99a1108b55bc9000","name":"AeroChaser Speeder Bike","source":{"id":"source:reference-99a1108b55bc9000","title":"AeroChaser Speeder Bike","revision":15746,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:07Z","sha256":"5cfd9cfb10095fda686d5745fa24255a163159a57329bdd0c44a3a780589dcdc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15746","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=AeroChaser%20Speeder%20Bike&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-99a1108b55bc9000","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by the engineers responsible for the Lhosan Industries ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swoop Racer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swoop_Racer?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the AeroChaser Speeder Bike is a quick and durable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bike"},", found on worlds throughout the galaxy. Designed and manufactured on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},", the AeroChaser is shipped to planets throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," and beyond. Sleek and fast, the AeroChaser is also relatively inexpensive because of the large quantities produced.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mandalorian Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mandalorian_Wars"},", Republic scouts used Lhosan AeroChasers on hotly contested worlds. The bikes were fast enough to outrun the Mandalorians' War Droids, allowing Republic agents to approach Mandalorian encampments, and retreat safely if discovered. During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Civil War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Civil_War"},", these Speeder Bikes fell out of military use, but remain extremely popular with civilians throughout the galaxy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Lhosan AeroChaser is a single-rider speeder bike with long prongs extending from the front of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},". Designed for balance, the front-end prongs also contain significantly empty space, which unscrupulous mechanics use to mount weapons on their Speeder Bikes. Others use the space for storage, and some have reduced the size of the prongs to allow the Speeder Bike to handle more loosely. These customizations illustrate how easily the Lhosan AeroChaser is modified, its molecularity make it a favorite ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," for outlaw techs.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["AeroChaser Speeder Bike Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-F